r Linux is broken.\nSo I tried 4.8.dev6 instead, still reproducible, added above again.\nThe XServer error is also still reproducible.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5910878727/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5930456485","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123994#issuecomment-5930456485","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123994","id":5930456485,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYXuVpQ","user":{"login":"notroid5","id":87585310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NTg1MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87585310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5","html_url":"https://github.com/notroid5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-01T11:33:31Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T11:33:31Z","body":"Also noticed that specifically disabling borderless changes the window size of a maximized window.\nNot sure about the cause, should I open another issue for that?\nCould be related, could be not.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"re